# -------------------------------------------------------
# Surface reactions for Ta-on-W, with neutralization
# No sputtering, no W creation. On reaction, ions → Ta.
# Reflection probabilities are handled in surf_collide
# via RN(θ), RE(θ).
# -------------------------------------------------------

# neutrals stay neutral (no-op, but keeps syntax uniform)
Ta      --> Ta
E S 1.0

# all ions neutralize to Ta when a reaction occurs
Ta+     --> Ta
E S 1.0

Ta2+    --> Ta
E S 1.0

Ta3+    --> Ta
E S 1.0

Ta4+    --> Ta
E S 1.0

Ta5+    --> Ta
E S 1.0

Ta6+    --> Ta
E S 1.0

Ta7+    --> Ta
E S 1.0

Ta8+    --> Ta
E S 1.0

Ta9+    --> Ta
E S 1.0

Ta10+   --> Ta
E S 1.0

